### Flight Fare Search - Economy Class
POST https://localhost:5001/api/FlightFare/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "NYC",
  "destination": "LON",
  "departureDate": "2024-06-15",
  "cabinClass": "Economy",
  "passengerCount": 2
}

###

### Flight Fare Search - Business Class with Custom Correlation ID
POST https://localhost:5001/api/FlightFare/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: custom-correlation-12345

{
  "origin": "LAX",
  "destination": "TYO",
  "departureDate": "2024-07-20",
  "cabinClass": "Business",
  "passengerCount": 1
}

###

### Flight Fare Search - First Class
POST https://localhost:5001/api/FlightFare/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "SFO",
  "destination": "SYD",
  "departureDate": "2024-08-10",
  "cabinClass": "First",
  "passengerCount": 3
}

